{# A *quoted* HTML attribute value -- the reflected search box
   (puppy-fort-factory/search.php's `value="<?= $q ?>"`), rendered as a Blade
   view body. Unlike the unquoted sibling sink, entity escaping IS the
   context-correct fix here, so this family's secure twin is the escaped one.
   Blade's RAW echo is used on purpose: a sink never escapes anything itself,
   so both twins share this fragment (see modules.py's docstring, decision 2). #}
<form class="{{ css_class }}" method="get" action="">
  <input type="text" name="{{ attr_name }}" value="{!! $value !!}">
  <button class="btn" type="submit">Search</button>
</form>
